    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Campbells are pleased to present this property to the open market.\n\nLocated within a small cul-de-sac in the townland of Meenacreeve, Annagry, the property enjoys a quiet setting along the Wild Atlantic Way. \n\nIt is conveniently positioned within easy reach of Annagry Village and its range of local amenities including shops, cafés, pubs and restaurants, while also being a short drive from Donegal Airport and Carrickfinn`s nearby Blue Flag Beach\n\nFor those with an interest in outdoor activities, Errigal, Slieve Sneacht and a number of popular surfing beaches are all within easy reach.\n\nThe Property is well laid out throughout and would make an ideal Family Home or Holiday Property.\n\nAccommodation comprises Entrance Hall, Kitchen, Spacious Living / Dining Area, Family Bathroom, Two Well-Proportioned Bedrooms and a Utility Cupboard Plumbed for a Washing Machine.\n\nThe First Floor comprises two further Bedrooms and a Bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a Garden Area and a Shed providing additional storage.\n\nViewing is by STRICT appointment only with Campbells.\n\nOur Ref: K1314\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 7.33m (24'1\") x 1.9m (6'3\")\nSolid Wooden Floor\n\nLiving Room - 5.46m (17'11\") x 5.5m (18'1\")\nSolid Wooden Floor, Open Fireplace, Under Stair Storage\n\nKitchen - 4.29m (14'1\") x 3.26m (10'8\")\nFitted Kitchen, Tiled floor and Splash back\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.37m (11'1\") x 3.23m (10'7\")\nSolid Wooden Floor\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.22m (10'7\") x 3.16m (10'4\")\nSolid Wooden Floor\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.36m (14'4\") x 4.25m (13'11\")\nCarpeted\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.37m (14'4\") x 3.24m (10'8\")\nCarpeted\n\nBathroom - 3.22m (10'7\") x 1.99m (6'6\")\nLinoleum Floor , Bath and Shower Area Finished with Wall Tiling, Bath, Electric Shower, Hand Basin, Toilet,\n\nLanding - 4.37m (14'4\") x 1.93m (6'4\")\nCarpeted\n\nUpstairs Bathroom - 1.89m (6'2\") x 1.41m (4'8\")\nLinoleum Floor, Tiled Electric Shower, Toilet, Hand Basin\n\nStorage Cupboard - 1.9m (6'3\") x 1.15m (3'9\")\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
